  "summary": "Malicious code in @onereach/step-run-snowflake-query (npm)",
  "details": "The package's preinstall hook (setup.mjs) downloads the Bun JavaScript runtime from github[.]com/oven-sh/bun and executes a 727KB heavily-obfuscated bundle (math_init.js, using a custom base64 decoder and dictionary-array obfuscation) at install time. The package declares its module entry as./dist/index.mjs but ships no dist/ directory — the tarball contains only the install hook, the obfuscated bundle, package.json, and README. No actual library code is delivered; the only executed content is the obfuscated install-time payload.",
